/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/H2Malic.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file.

  The NEUTRAL, undissociated aqueous malic acid (d,l-hydroxybutanedioic acid): the
  speciation MASTER of the malate family, from which HMalic- and Malic2- are formed by
  the records in chemistry/ (the tartrate pattern, species/H2Tart.dat).  No `aqueousThermo`
  here, as for H2Tart.  Key names: H2Malic/HMalic/Malic, not Mal*, so they cannot be
  confused with the maleate keys H2Male/HMale/Male.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    H2Malic;
formula     "H2C4H4O5";
charge  0;
MW { value 134.087; unit g/mol;}
